"00:53.990">got </span><span begin="00:53.990" end="00:54.140">the </span><span begin="00:54.140" end="00:54.440">right </span><span begin="00:54.440" end="00:54.710">to </span><span begin="00:54.710" end="00:55.070">get </span><span begin="00:55.070" end="00:55.880">naughty</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.910" end="00:59.600"><span begin="00:55.910" end="00:56.390">So </span><span begin="00:56.390" end="00:56.420">ooh</span><span begin="00:56.420" end="00:57.260">-</span><span begin="00:57.260" end="00:57.290">ooh </span><span begin="00:57.290" end="00:57.530">be </span><span begin="00:57.530" end="00:57.980">mean</span><span begin="00:57.980" end="00:57.980">, </span><span begin="00:57.980" end="00:58.160">be </span><span begin="00:58.160" end="00:58.610">mean </span><span begin="00:58.610" end="00:58.790">to </span><span begin="00:58.790" end="00:59.600">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.780" end="01:01.400"><span begin="00:59.780" end="01:00.080">Be </span><span begin="01:00.080" end="01:00.530">mean </span><span begin="01:00.530" end="01:00.830">to </span><span begin="01:00.830" end="01:01.400">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.400" end="01:03.440"><span begin="01:01.400" end="01:01.460">You </span><span begin="01:01.460" end="01:01.760">say </span><span begin="01:01.760" end="01:01.820">you </span><span begin="01:01.820" end="01:02.120">gotta </span><span begin="01:02.120" end="01:02.330">be </span><span begin="01:02.330" end="01:02.450">the </span><span begin="01:02.450" end="01:03.440">boss</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.620" end="01:05.600"><span begin="01:03.620" end="01:03.950">'Cause </span><span begin="01:03.950" end="01:04.010">you </span><span begin="01:04.010" end="01:04.340">pay </span><span begin="01:04.340" end="01:04.670">them </span><span begin="01:04.670" end="01:05.600">bills</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.140" end="01:08.240"><span begin="01:06.140" end="01:06.500">There's </span><span begin="0