 end="01:22.700">If </span><span begin="01:22.700" end="01:23.210">pain's </span><span begin="01:23.210" end="01:23.750">what </span><span begin="01:23.750" end="01:23.960">you </span><span begin="01:23.960" end="01:26.870">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.260" end="01:32.930"><span begin="01:27.260" end="01:28.280">Torture </span><span begin="01:28.280" end="01:28.910">me </span><span begin="01:28.910" end="01:29.210">all </span><span begin="01:29.210" end="01:32.930">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.930" end="01:34.520"><span begin="01:32.930" end="01:33.140">Keep </span><span begin="01:33.140" end="01:33.380">on </span><span begin="01:33.380" end="01:34.520">burnin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.520" end="01:36.770"><span begin="01:34.520" end="01:34.880">Love </span><span begin="01:34.880" end="01:35.150">how </span><span begin="01:35.150" end="01:35.300">you </span><span begin="01:35.300" end="01:35.630">keep </span><span begin="01:35.630" end="01:35.900">me </span><span begin="01:35.900" end="01:36.770">hurting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.770" end="01:40.460"><span begin="01:36.770" end="01:37.280">So </span><span begin="01:37.280" end="01:37.310">ooh</span><span begin="01:37.310" end="01:38.120">-</span><span begin="01:38.120" end="01:38.150">ooh </span><span begin="01:38.150" end="01:38.390">be </span><span begin="01:38.390" end="01:38.840">mean</span><span begin="01:38.840" end="01:38.840">, </span><span begin="01:38.840" end="01:39.020">be </span><span begin="01:39.020" end="01:39.500">mean </span><span begin="01:39.500" end="01:39.620">to </span><span begin="01:39.620" end="01:40.460">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.670" end="01:43.010"><span begin="01:40.670" end="01:40.940">Be </span><span begin="01:40.940" end="01:41.420">mean </span><span begin="01:41.420" end="01:41.690">to </span><span begin="01:41.690" end="01:43.010">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.010" end="01:46.940"><spa